<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>It's a script for Russinan fishing 4 .Fishind with jiging technique.
How to use: Justcast the bait where you need (with your spinning/ casting tackle) you need and launch the script. 
The script checks is the fish on hook or not.
You do not need to use any specific resolution to use the script.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 1210 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 2 s
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 21 1
GoWhile 1 22222222</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Russian Fishing 4</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>